@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-32 - View All Orders

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-32
FE -> API: GET /payments/orders
API -> Service: Execute View All Orders
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách tất cả orders hiển thị

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Không có đơn hàng -> empty table
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Danh sách tất cả orders hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/purchases
2. System gọi API GET /payments/orders
3. System trả về tất cả bills (paginated)
4. Admin có thể filter/sort theo status, date, amount
end note
@enduml
